00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:19.000
(Laughter)

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Yeah. "Lingua this, Frankie."

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.000
(Laughter)

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.000
And I suppose it's a contradiction that I

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.000
